    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="050ab67f-9b87-5908-a77d-8a04fb8531d4" activityNameId="cc83b4ba-3277-5137-8caf-fe6459ea04c0" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Industrial wood, hardwood, under bark, u=80%, at forest road</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Industrial wood, hardwood, under bark, u=80%, at forest road
The  volume refers to the wood not including the bark. The multi-output process "hardwood, thinning/final cutting, under bark" delivers the three coproducts "round wood, hardwood, under bark, u=70%, at forest road", "residual wood, hardwood, under bark, u=80%, at forest road" and "industrial wood, hardwood, under bark, u=80%, at forest road". Allocation is based on the over-all proceeds of the site.;
UUID: 50a182a7-3772-3b50-8155-9465a171663c
Includes motormanual processes for thinning and final cutting as well as transport of the products to the nearest forest road.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Considers only one type of forest interventions (Motormanual processes for "Buche, II. Ertragsklasse, starke Durchforstung")
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: The assumption that Germany is representative for central Europe is considered in the uncertainties.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_50a182a7-3772-3b50-8155-9465a171663c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
